      "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"studio:contract\" content=\"v0\">\n  <meta name=\"studio:format\" content=\"1080x1350\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/brand/brand.css\">\n  <style>\n    [data-artboard] {\n      position: relative;\n      background: var(--color-paper);\n    }\n\n    /* Upper field: the bag surface (mist), carries the one loud statement */\n    .bag-field {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      top: 0;\n      width: 1080px;\n      height: 924px;\n      background: var(--color-mist);\n    }\n\n    /* Display caps: wide black italic, three words stacked so PRAK / PRAK align */\n    .headline {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 72px;\n      top: 80px;\n      width: 936px;\n      font-family: var(--font-display);\n      font-size: 152px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-stretch: 125%;\n      line-height: 0.98;\n      letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      text-wrap: balance;\n      hyphens: manual;\n      color: var(--color-ink);\n    }\n    .headline .slash {\n      color: var(--color-green-deep);\n    }\n\n    /* Label band with the raised centre tab, quoted from the pack's label edge */\n    .label-band {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      top: 892px;\n      width: 1080px;\n      height: 40px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .label-band-tab {\n      flex: none;\n      width: 216px;\n      height: 24px;\n      background: var(--color-green);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0 0;\n    }\n    .label-band-bar {\n      flex: none;\n      width: 1080px;\n      height: 16px;\n      background: var(--color-green);\n    }\n\n    /* Lower field: the label, set in label typography */\n    .label-text {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 72px;\n      top: 996px;\n      width: 776px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      gap: var(--space-16);\n    }\n    .eyebrow {\n      font-family: var(--font-text);\n      font-size: 26px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n      letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: var(--color-green-deep);\n    }\n    .eyebrow-rule {\n      flex: none;\n      width: var(--rule-width);\n      height: var(--rule-thickness);\n      background: var(--color-green);\n    }\n    .body {\n      width: 100%;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n      font-family: var(--font-text);\n      font-size: 36px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      line-height: 1.34;\n      text-wrap: balance;\n      hyphens: manual;\n      color: var(--color-graphite);\n    }\n    .body b {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--color-ink);\n    }\n\n    /* Sign-off: logo left, web address right, same position on every post */\n    .sign-off {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 72px;\n      top: 1234px;\n      width: 936px;\n      height: 44px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: row;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n    .logo {\n      flex: none;\n      height: 44px;\n      width: auto;\n    }\n    .web {\n      font-family: var(--font-text);\n      font-size: 28px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n      color: var(--color-graphite);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main data-artboard style=\"width:1080px;height:1350px\">\n\n    <div data-layer=\"bag-field\" data-type=\"shape\" data-role=\"decoration\" class=\"bag-field\"></div>\n\n    <h1 data-layer=\"headline\" data-type=\"text\" data-role=\"headline\" class=\"headline\">Toprak<span class=\"slash\">/</span><br>yaprak<br>analizi</h1>\n\n    <div data-layer=\"label-band\" data-type=\"group\" data-role=\"decoration\" class=\"label-band\">\n      <div data-layer=\"label-band-tab\" data-type=\"shape\" data-role=\"decoration\" class=\"label-band-tab\"></div>\n      <div data-layer=\"label-band-bar\" data-type=\"shape\" data-role=\"decoration\" class=\"label-band-bar\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div data-layer=\"label-text\" data-type=\"group\" class=\"label-text\">\n      <p data-layer=\"eyebrow\" data-type=\"text\" data-role=\"eyebrow\" class=\"eyebrow\">Etiketteki öneri</p>\n      <div data-layer=\"eyebrow-rule\" data-type=\"shape\" data-role=\"decoration\" class=\"eyebrow-rule\"></div>\n      <p data-layer=\"body\" data-type=\"text\" data-role=\"body\" class=\"body\"><b>Venta Borinc</b>’i analiz yaptırarak kullanmanız tavsiye edilir.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div data-layer=\"sign-off\" data-type=\"group\" class=\"sign-off\">\n      <img data-layer=\"logo-venta\" data-type=\"logo\" class=\"logo\" src=\"/brand/logos/venta-wordmark-black.standin.png\" alt=\"Venta\">\n      <p data-layer=\"web\" data-type=\"text\" data-role=\"caption\" class=\"web\">www.mtmagro.com</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
  ],
  "caption": "Venta Borinc etiketindeki öneri: toprak ve/veya yaprak analizi.\n\nVenta Borinc; bor (B) ve çinko (Zn) içeren bir mikro bitki besin maddeleri karışımıdır. Etiketinde de belirtildiği gibi, ürünün toprak ve/veya yaprak analizi yaptırılarak kullanılması tavsiye edilir.\n\nKullanmadan önce etiketi okuyunuz.\n\n#Venta #MTMAgro #Borinc #BitkiBesleme",
  "rationale": "The idea comes from the label's own words: TOPRAK and YAPRAK differ only in their first two letters, so stacked in the wide black italic display caps their PRAK endings line up. The label's 've/veya' becomes the post's only colour accent, a green slash that echoes the slant of the VENTA logotype. The layout copies the pack: a mist 'bag surface' carries the one loud headline, and a green label band with the raised centre tab separates it from a white 'label' area, where the recommendation is set in label typography (green-deep eyebrow, short green rule, graphite text) above the standard sign-off. The copy stays with the label sentence, with no benefits, doses or numbers added. The B/Zn hexagon badges are left out because the topic is analysis, not the elements, and white letters on amber or leaf green would fail the contrast check.",
